---
manual: border.over_background
lines: [2817, 2818]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: C12
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 200, height: 200 do
  stack left: 0, top: 0, width: 100, height: 100 do
    background red
    border blue, strokewidth: 10
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_equal [0, 0, 255], pixel_at(5, 50).first(3), "the border paints over the background's edge"
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(15, 50).first(3), "just inside the border the background shows"
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(50, 50).first(3), "and in the middle"
